* [[File:Coat of arms (emblem) of Iraq 2008.svg|25px]] - The national [[emblem of Iraq]] features the Takbir (Allahu Akbar).<ref>{{cite web |title=Iraq National Symbols, Song, Flags and More |url=https://www.worldatlas.com/webimage/countrys/asia/iraq/iqsymbols.htm |website=Worldatlas.com |date=2017-04-07}}</ref>
* [[File:Coat of Arms of Jordan.svg|25px]] - The national [[emblem of Jordan]] includes the phrase Al-Raji min Allah al-Tawfiq wa al-'Awn (Hoping for Allah's guidance and help).<ref>{{cite web |last1=|first1= |title=The Coat of Arms of the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan |url=http://www.kinghussein.gov.jo/coat_arms.html |website=A Living Tribute to the Legacy of King Hussein I |archive-url=https://www.webcitation.org/75DFHjT5P?url=http://www.kinghussein.gov.jo/coat_arms.html |archive-date=6 Jan 2019}}</ref>
