# Unknown daughter,{{efn|Mielzarek suggests that she might have been the same daughter as Adelheid if she became a nun after her husband's death in 1148 or 1149.{{sfn|Mielzarek|2020|p=274}}}} married before 1146 Otto the Younger, son of [[Otto I, Count of Salm|Otto of Salm]]{{sfn|Mielzarek|2020|pp=274-275}}
